# Harness install output — generated, never committed (AGENTS.md: "nothing
# generated is ever committed"). .opencode/, .claude/, and .agents/ are wholly
# tomo-owned; .codex/ and .github/ share space with hand-authored config, so
# only tomo's subpaths are ignored there.
.opencode/
.claude/
.agents/
.codex/agents/
.github/skills/tomo-*/
.github/agents/*.agent.md
